// Each example demonstrates a distinct outcome in the decision report.
BUY 100 EUR OF MSFT IF RSI(MSFT, 14) < 30 && PRICE(MSFT) < 120
SELL QTY 1 OF MSFT IF PRICE(MSFT) > 200 || MSFT.volume > 1000
BUY QTY 1 OF MSFT IF PRICE(MSFT) > 200 && PRICE(UNKNOWN) > 0
BUY QTY 1 OF MSFT IF PRICE(MSFT) < 120 || PRICE(UNKNOWN) > 0
